[
    {
        "content": "<p>I am trying to create a command <code>#texify</code> to print LaTeX versions of objects. (Right now, I only need this for actual evaluated objects, not the <code>Expr</code> type, so <code>#texify</code> is like <code>#eval</code> but with a different pretty-printer). But I'm getting weird behavior when I enable the module system. I have</p>\n<p>Texify.lean</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">module</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Command</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unsafe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">evalStringUnsafe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TermElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">evalTerm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mkConst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">``String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">implemented_by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">evalStringUnsafe</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">opaque</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">evalString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TermElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"#texify\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">liftTermElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">evalString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">println!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Test.lean</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">module</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AInfinity</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Texify</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">natToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{n}\"</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">finToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{x}\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- These all succeed</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">texify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">natToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">texify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">natToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">texify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">finToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">/-</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">Invalid `meta` definition `_tmp✝`, `SimplexCategory.mk` is not accessible here;</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">consider adding `public meta import Mathlib.AlgebraicTopology.SimplexCategory.Defs`</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">texify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">finToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Adding <code>public import Mathlib</code> or disabling the module system in <code>Test.lean</code> fixes the issue. Adding <code>public meta import Mathlib.AlgebraicTopology.SimplexCategory.Basic</code> as an input also fixes it.</p>\n<p>Does anyone know why this is happening, or why <code>SimplexCategory.mk</code> is showing up despite the fact that I never mentioned it?</p>",
        "id": 591308118,
        "sender_full_name": "Niels Voss",
        "timestamp": 1777363725
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Apparently the fact that I had split them into separate files was a red herring.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">module</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- public meta import Mathlib.AlgebraicTopology.SimplexCategory.Basic</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Command</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unsafe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">evalStringUnsafe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TermElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">evalTerm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mkConst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">``String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">implemented_by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">evalStringUnsafe</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">opaque</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">evalString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TermElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"#texify\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">liftTermElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">evalString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">println!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">natToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{n}\"</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">finToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{x}\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">texify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">natToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">texify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">natToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">texify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">finToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">texify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">finToString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- Errors</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>In this file, moving off the module system or uncommenting the <code>public meta import ...</code> will fix the error.</p>",
        "id": 591309986,
        "sender_full_name": "Niels Voss",
        "timestamp": 1777364331
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Oh no, <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=SimplexCategory.instOfNatToTypeOrderHomFinHAddNatLenOfNat#doc\">docs#SimplexCategory.instOfNatToTypeOrderHomFinHAddNatLenOfNat</a> is an instance of <code>OfNat (Fin (n + 1)) m</code>! Thankfully not a diamond but still a separate instance that is currently used per default for <code>Fin (n + 1)</code> with <code>import Mathlib</code>.</p>",
        "id": 591392381,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1777384871
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Do you know why this causes issues with the <code>#texify</code> command defined above but not with <code>#eval</code>, or why the problem only appears when <code>x</code> is inlined?</p>",
        "id": 591440097,
        "sender_full_name": "Niels Voss",
        "timestamp": 1777396219
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Are you aware of <a href=\"https://github.com/kmill/LeanTeX\">https://github.com/kmill/LeanTeX</a> ?</p>",
        "id": 591448660,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1777398739
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>What's actually responsible for the problem here is that you need these options: <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0a6c31520b2ebaa6e71227454b46ebfb4986ae7b/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L99-L104\">https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0a6c31520b2ebaa6e71227454b46ebfb4986ae7b/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L99-L104</a><br>\n... and you need to <code>public import Lean.Compiler.Options</code>, for some reason</p>",
        "id": 591707795,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1777448164
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I had heard of LeanTeX but hadn't investigated deeply. My use case is slightly different; I want to make latex from evaluation output, not expressions. However, texifying expressions sounds useful and I might use it in the future.</p>",
        "id": 591717662,
        "sender_full_name": "Niels Voss",
        "timestamp": 1777450860
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"873547\">Robin Arnez</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/239415-metaprogramming-.2F-tactics/topic/SimplexCategory.2Emk.20.2B.20module.20system.20breaks.20evalTerm/near/591707795\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What's actually responsible for the problem here is that you need these options: <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0a6c31520b2ebaa6e71227454b46ebfb4986ae7b/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L99-L104\">https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0a6c31520b2ebaa6e71227454b46ebfb4986ae7b/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L99-L104</a><br>\n... and you need to <code>public import Lean.Compiler.Options</code>, for some reason</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This worked, thank you!</p>",
        "id": 591719210,
        "sender_full_name": "Niels Voss",
        "timestamp": 1777451255
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I started a discussion on the duplicate instance here: <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"287929\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/Unintended.20OfNat.20.28Fin.20.28n.20.2B.201.29.29.20from.20SimplexCategory/with/591721007\">#mathlib4 &gt; Unintended OfNat (Fin (n + 1)) from SimplexCategory</a></p>",
